"meta=None content=[TextContent(type='text', text='{\"items\": [{\"id\": \"shell.fc_block.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"shell.fc_block.v17\", \"title\": \"FC块与CompileUnit外壳\", \"description\": \"最小FC块、Interface、ObjectList和单个LAD CompileUnit的层级。\", \"role\": \"block_shell\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"xml_fragment\", \"content_path\": \"shells/fc_block_shell.xml\", \"intent\": [\"FC块\", \"块外壳\", \"CompileUnit\"], \"not_for\": [\"FB实例声明\"], \"provides\": [\"fc_shell\", \"interface\", \"compile_unit\"], \"requires\": [], \"replace\": [\"块名\", \"Interface成员\", \"CompileUnit\"], \"preserve\": [\"Document层级\", \"Engineering V17\", \"ProgrammingLanguage LAD\"], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/basic/01_串联_触点线圈.xml\"], \"status\": \"golden\", \"contains\": {\"parts\": [], \"calls\": [], \"access_scopes\": []}}, \"content\": \"<?xml version=\\\\\"1.0\\\\\" encoding=\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\"?>\\\\n<!-- verified_v17_sample: PLC块主体由Interface和CompileUnit集合构成；每个LAD Network通常是一个CompileUnit。 -->\\\\n<Document>\\\\n  <Engineering version=\\\\\"V17\\\\\" />\\\\n  <SW.Blocks.FC ID=\\\\\"0\\\\\">\\\\n    <AttributeList>\\\\n      <AutoNumber>true</AutoNumber>\\\\n      <Interface><Sections xmlns=\\\\\"http://www.siemens.com/automation/Openness/SW/Interface/v5\\\\\">\\\\n        <Section Name=\\\\\"Input\\\\\" /><Section Name=\\\\\"Output\\\\\" /><Section Name=\\\\\"InOut\\\\\" />\\\\n        <Section Name=\\\\\"Temp\\\\\" /><Section Name=\\\\\"Constant\\\\\" />\\\\n        <Section Name=\\\\\"Return\\\\\"><Member Name=\\\\\"Ret_Val\\\\\" Datatype=\\\\\"Void\\\\\" Accessibility=\\\\\"Public\\\\\" /></Section>\\\\n      </Sections></Interface>\\\\n      <MemoryLayout>Optimized</MemoryLayout><Name>FC_Name</Name><ProgrammingLanguage>LAD</ProgrammingLanguage>\\\\n    </AttributeList>\\\\n    <ObjectList>\\\\n      <SW.Blocks.CompileUnit ID=\\\\\"1\\\\\" CompositionName=\\\\\"CompileUnits\\\\\">\\\\n        <AttributeList>\\\\n          <NetworkSource><FlgNet xmlns=\\\\\"http://www.siemens.com/automation/Openness/SW/NetworkSource/FlgNet/v4\\\\\"><Parts /><Wires /></FlgNet></NetworkSource>\\\\n          <ProgrammingLanguage>LAD</ProgrammingLanguage>\\\\n        </AttributeList>\\\\n      </SW.Blocks.CompileUnit>\\\\n    </ObjectList>\\\\n  </SW.Blocks.FC>\\\\n</Document>\\\\n\"}, {\"id\": \"topology.series_contact_coil.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"topology.series_contact_coil.v17\", \"title\": \"串联触点到线圈\", \"description\": \"常开、常闭触点串联驱动普通线圈，含完整Access和Wire。\", \"role\": \"topology_pattern\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"xml_fragment\", \"content_path\": \"topology/series_contact_coil.xml\", \"intent\": [\"串联\", \"常开触点\", \"常闭触点\", \"线圈\"], \"not_for\": [\"并联分支\"], \"provides\": [\"series_flow\", \"contact\", \"coil\"], \"requires\": [\"变量已声明\"], \"replace\": [\"变量路径\", \"UId\"], \"preserve\": [\"Part与Wire耦合\", \"operand端口\"], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/basic/01_串联_触点线圈.xml\"], \"status\": \"golden\", \"contains\": {\"parts\": [\"Contact\", \"Coil\"], \"calls\": [], \"access_scopes\": [\"GlobalVariable\"]}}, \"content\": \"<?xml version=\\\\\"1.0\\\\\" encoding=\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\"?>\\\\n<!-- verified_v17_sample: Parts与对应Wires是一个不可拆分的网络知识单元。UId只需在本CompileUnit内唯一。 -->\\\\n<FlgNet xmlns=\\\\\"http://www.siemens.com/automation/Openness/SW/NetworkSource/FlgNet/v4\\\\\">\\\\n  <Parts>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"1\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"Start\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"2\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"Stop\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"3\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"Run\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Part Name=\\\\\"Contact\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" />\\\\n    <Part Name=\\\\\"Contact\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\"><Negated Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Part>\\\\n    <Part Name=\\\\\"Coil\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" />\\\\n  </Parts>\\\\n  <Wires>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"20\\\\\"><Powerrail /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"21\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"1\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"22\\\\\"><NameCon UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"out\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"23\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"2\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"24\\\\\"><NameCon UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"out\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"25\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"3\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n  </Wires>\\\\n</FlgNet>\\\\n\"}, {\"id\": \"topology.parallel_set_reset.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"topology.parallel_set_reset.v17\", \"title\": \"并联置位复位与状态保持\", \"description\": \"共享Powerrail的两支路SCoil/RCoil状态保持模式。\", \"role\": \"topology_pattern\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"xml_fragment\", \"content_path\": \"topology/parallel_set_reset.xml\", \"intent\": [\"并联\", \"置位\", \"复位\", \"状态保持\"], \"not_for\": [\"普通瞬时线圈\"], \"provides\": [\"parallel_branches\", \"set_coil\", \"reset_coil\", \"latched_state\"], \"requires\": [\"状态变量为Bool\"], \"replace\": [\"变量路径\", \"UId\"], \"preserve\": [\"单一Powerrail\", \"重复变量使用独立Access\"], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/basic/02_并联_多支路.xml\", \"data/rag/raw/application/报警.xml\", \"data/rag/raw/application/设定值传递.xml\"], \"status\": \"golden\", \"contains\": {\"parts\": [\"Contact\", \"SCoil\", \"RCoil\"], \"calls\": [], \"access_scopes\": [\"GlobalVariable\"]}}, \"content\": \"<?xml version=\\\\\"1.0\\\\\" encoding=\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\"?>\\\\n<!-- verified_v17_sample: 多支路共享同一Powerrail Wire；SCoil/RCoil与各自Access和Wire保持成组。 -->\\\\n<FlgNet xmlns=\\\\\"http://www.siemens.com/automation/Openness/SW/NetworkSource/FlgNet/v4\\\\\">\\\\n  <Parts>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"1\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"SetCmd\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"2\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"State\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"3\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"ResetCmd\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Access Scope=\\\\\"GlobalVariable\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"4\\\\\"><Symbol><Component Name=\\\\\"DB1\\\\\" /><Component Name=\\\\\"State\\\\\" /></Symbol></Access>\\\\n    <Part Name=\\\\\"Contact\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" /><Part Name=\\\\\"SCoil\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\" />\\\\n    <Part Name=\\\\\"Contact\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" /><Part Name=\\\\\"RCoil\\\\\" UId=\\\\\"13\\\\\" />\\\\n  </Parts>\\\\n  <Wires>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"20\\\\\"><Powerrail /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"21\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"1\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"22\\\\\"><NameCon UId=\\\\\"10\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"out\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"23\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"2\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"11\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"24\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"3\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"25\\\\\"><NameCon UId=\\\\\"12\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"out\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"13\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"in\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n    <Wire UId=\\\\\"26\\\\\"><IdentCon UId=\\\\\"4\\\\\" /><NameCon UId=\\\\\"13\\\\\" Name=\\\\\"operand\\\\\" /></Wire>\\\\n  </Wires>\\\\n</FlgNet>\\\\n\"}, {\"id\": \"network_text.title_comment.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"network_text.title_comment.v17\", \"title\": \"Network标题和功能注释\", \"description\": \"CompileUnit下Title与Comment的完整MultilingualText结构。\", \"role\": \"network_text_pattern\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"xml_fragment\", \"content_path\": \"network_text/title_and_comment.xml\", \"intent\": [\"Network标题\", \"功能注释\", \"多语言文本\"], \"not_for\": [\"块级注释\"], \"provides\": [\"network_title\", \"network_comment\", \"multilingual_text\"], \"requires\": [\"CompileUnit存在\"], \"replace\": [\"文本\", \"Culture\", \"对象ID\"], \"preserve\": [\"CompositionName\", \"ObjectList层级\"], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/application/Main.xml\"], \"status\": \"golden\", \"contains\": {\"parts\": [], \"calls\": [], \"access_scopes\": []}}, \"content\": \"<?xml version=\\\\\"1.0\\\\\" encoding=\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\"?>\\\\n<!-- verified_v17_sample: Network标题和功能注释位于CompileUnit的ObjectList，均保留完整MultilingualText层级。 -->\\\\n<SW.Blocks.CompileUnit ID=\\\\\"3\\\\\" CompositionName=\\\\\"CompileUnits\\\\\">\\\\n  <AttributeList>\\\\n    <NetworkSource><FlgNet xmlns=\\\\\"http://www.siemens.com/automation/Openness/SW/NetworkSource/FlgNet/v4\\\\\"><Parts /><Wires /></FlgNet></NetworkSource>\\\\n    <ProgrammingLanguage>LAD</ProgrammingLanguage>\\\\n  </AttributeList>\\\\n  <ObjectList>\\\\n    <MultilingualText ID=\\\\\"4\\\\\" CompositionName=\\\\\"Comment\\\\\"><ObjectList><MultilingualTextItem ID=\\\\\"5\\\\\" CompositionName=\\\\\"Items\\\\\"><AttributeList><Culture>zh-CN</Culture><Text>说明本Network的功能与边界。</Text></AttributeList></MultilingualTextItem></ObjectList></MultilingualText>\\\\n    <MultilingualText ID=\\\\\"6\\\\\" CompositionName=\\\\\"Title\\\\\"><ObjectList><MultilingualTextItem ID=\\\\\"7\\\\\" CompositionName=\\\\\"Items\\\\\"><AttributeList><Culture>zh-CN</Culture><Text>Network标题</Text></AttributeList></MultilingualTextItem></ObjectList></MultilingualText>\\\\n  </ObjectList>\\\\n</SW.Blocks.CompileUnit>\\\\n\"}, {\"id\": \"guide.simaticml_block_structure.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"guide.simaticml_block_structure.v17\", \"title\": \"SimaticML块结构规则\", \"description\": \"Interface、CompileUnit、FlgNet以及导入与编译边界。\", \"role\": \"rule_guide\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"rule_document\", \"content_path\": \"guides/simaticml_block_structure.md\", \"intent\": [\"块结构\", \"CompileUnit\"], \"not_for\": [], \"provides\": [\"block_structure_rules\"], \"requires\": [], \"replace\": [], \"preserve\": [], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/application/Main.xml\", \"src/scdw/mcp/tools.py\"], \"status\": \"golden\"}, \"content\": \"# SimaticML 块结构（V17）\\\\n\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：PLC 块主体包含 `Interface` 与 `ObjectList` 中的 `SW.Blocks.CompileUnit`；每个 LAD Network 通常对应一个 CompileUnit。\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：CompileUnit 的 `NetworkSource/FlgNet` 由 `Parts` 和 `Wires` 组成。Network 还应在自身 `ObjectList` 中包含 Title 和 Comment 的完整 `MultilingualText` 结构。\\\\n- `project_debug_experience`：导入成功只说明 XML 被 TIA 接受，不代表符号、类型和调用关系可编译；最终必须以 TIA V17 编译结果为准。\\\\n\"}, {\"id\": \"guide.uid_reference_rules.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"guide.uid_reference_rules.v17\", \"title\": \"UId与引用规则\", \"description\": \"CompileUnit内唯一性、嵌套Access和连接引用规则。\", \"role\": \"rule_guide\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"rule_document\", \"content_path\": \"guides/uid_and_reference_rules.md\", \"intent\": [\"UId\", \"IdentCon\", \"NameCon\"], \"not_for\": [], \"provides\": [\"uid_rules\", \"reference_rules\"], \"requires\": [], \"replace\": [], \"preserve\": [], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/application/Main.xml\", \"data/rag/raw/basic/07_数组访问与IO标签.xml\"], \"status\": \"golden\"}, \"content\": \"# UId 与引用规则\\\\n\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：statements、CallInfo 和 operands 使用 UId 作为当前 CompileUnit 内的引用键；样本在不同 CompileUnit 中重复使用相同 UId。\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：UId 不要求跨整个块连续，也不携带业务语义。\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：嵌套的数组下标 Access 没有 UId，只有最外层 Access 被 `IdentCon` 引用。\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：`IdentCon` 引用 Access；`NameCon` 引用 Part 或 Call，并使用该元素的实际端口名。\\\\n\"}, {\"id\": \"guide.part_wire_coupling.v17\", \"metadata\": {\"id\": \"guide.part_wire_coupling.v17\", \"title\": \"Part与Wire成组规则\", \"description\": \"Access、Part、Call、Wire不可拆分及拓扑注意事项。\", \"role\": \"rule_guide\", \"tia_version\": \"V17\", \"content_type\": \"rule_document\", \"content_path\": \"guides/part_wire_coupling.md\", \"intent\": [\"Parts\", \"Wires\", \"拓扑\"], \"not_for\": [], \"provides\": [\"part_wire_rules\"], \"requires\": [], \"replace\": [], \"preserve\": [], \"source_refs\": [\"data/rag/raw/basic/02_并联_多支路.xml\", \"src/scdw/mcp/tools.py\"], \"status\": \"golden\"}, \"content\": \"# Part、Call 与 Wire 成组规则\\\\n\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：Access、Part/Call 与 Wire 共同构成可理解的 LAD 网络；不得只复制 Part。\\\\n- `verified_v17_sample`：分叉可在一条 Wire 中由一个上游端口连接多个下游端口；并联起始支路共享同一 Powerrail Wire。\\\\n- `project_debug_experience`：LAD 元素存在代码生成顺序约束，但不要把导出 XML 中偶然的 Wire 文本顺序解释成动作优先级。\\\\n\"}]}', annotations=None)] isError=False"